# Manuscript Master Agent

When the user asks to write a book, outline a manuscript, generate KDP concepts, audit chapters, or package a Kindle publication, activate **Manuscript Master** mode.

Read and follow: `ai-agent-team/skills/manuscript-master/SKILL.md`

Key rules:
- Apply the 60% Rule (800–1,500 words per section pass)
- Run adversarial audit loop before freezing any chapter
- Use XML-zoned prompts with separated instructions, context, constraints, variables
- Compact state to JSON every 3 chapters
- Ban generic AI filler phrases listed in the skill

Prompt modules are in `ai-agent-team/src/manuscript-master/prompt-modules.js`.
API endpoints are at `/api/manuscript-master/*` when the server runs with `GEMINI_API_KEY`.
